# Risk and deployment
- Risk controls are required design inputs, not late additions.
- Distinguish signal logic, trade risk, account risk, and operational risk.
- Do not hard-code secrets, account identifiers, or webhook credentials.
- Generated alerts require deduplication, payload, frequency, and failure-mode review.
- Live deployment remains blocked until explicit human approval and paper/forward-test evidence.
